('watery grave', 'Usage: cast watery grave [<target>]\n\nA drowning attack against a single target. Not yet wired to a real effect -- consumes its component/symbol and does nothing further yet.\nRequires: some withered jetsam\nRelated: skills practice cast pray affects\nApprox. Level: 32\nDiscipline: 25%\nClasses: Mage', 'seed'),
